      {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "mainEntity": [
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "How long is the data science course in Pune?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>The regular course takes about 5 months (4 to 5 months depending on your batch). The fast-track batch takes 2 to 3 months with daily sessions. Online batches follow the batch schedule.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What are the data science course fees in Pune at 3RI Technologies?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>The fee depends on the batch type, the mode (classroom, online or hybrid) and current offers, so call or WhatsApp us on +91 830 810 3366 for the exact figure. You can pay through 0% interest EMI: 10% on registration, 70% in the first month and 20% in the second. For comparison, most 4 to 6 month data science programs in Pune cost ₹35,000 to ₹70,000. See our <a href=\"https://www.3ritechnologies.com/data-science-course-fees-duration-pune/\">data science course fees and duration guide</a>.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Can I join without a coding or IT background?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>Yes. The course starts with Excel, basic statistics and Python from scratch, and many of our students come from commerce, arts, mechanical and other non-IT fields. Read <a href=\"https://www.3ritechnologies.com/data-science-course-eligibility-after-12th-graduation/\">who is eligible for a data science course</a>.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Who is eligible for data science training in Pune?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>Graduates, postgraduates, college students and working professionals from any stream can join. Knowing some Python, SQL or statistics helps but is not required.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Do you offer data science classes on weekends?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>Yes. The weekend batch runs on Saturday and Sunday from 9:00 AM to 1:00 PM and is our most popular batch with working professionals. We also run weekday morning and evening batches.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Can I take the course online instead of in a classroom?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>Yes. Live online batches use the same syllabus, the same trainers and the same placement support as our Pune classroom batches. You can also choose hybrid: learn online and do project work on campus. We also have a dedicated <a href=\"https://www.3ritechnologies.com/course/data-science-online-training/\">online data science course</a> page.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Which programming languages and tools will I learn?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>You will mainly use Python and SQL, along with Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib, Seaborn, SciPy, Scikit-learn, XGBoost, TensorFlow and Keras, Power BI, Excel, Git and GitHub, and Generative AI tools like ChatGPT and Claude.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Do you provide placement assistance after the course?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>Yes. Placement support covers interview questions, resume and LinkedIn building, aptitude and soft skills, a 5-day mock interview program, and interview scheduling with our hiring partners. If you are interviewing but not yet placed after the course, we keep supporting you until you are.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What salary can I expect after a data science course?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>In Pune, freshers in data roles typically earn ₹4 to 7 LPA. With 1 to 3 years of experience this usually rises to ₹7 to 12 LPA, and senior data scientists can earn ₹18 to 30 LPA or more. Your salary depends on the company, the role and your skills.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Will I work on real projects?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>Yes. You build 21 real-time projects, including two capstones (delivery duration prediction and machine failure prediction), plus Power BI dashboards and industry case studies in insurance, healthcare, HR, manufacturing and sales.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What certificate will I get?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>You receive a 3RI Technologies course completion certificate and an internship certificate once you finish the course and projects.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Can I attend a demo class before joining?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>Yes. You can join a free demo class online or on campus. Use the Book a free demo class button on this page, or call +91 830 810 3366.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Where are your data science classes in Pune?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>We have three branches: Pimple Saudagar (Rainbow Plaza), Deccan (DurgaShankar, near Sambhaji Park) and Nal Stop (Mantri Vertex, Law College Road). You can also join live online from anywhere.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What happens if I have doubts after the course ends?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>You keep lifetime access to the study material, and you can reach our mentors for doubt clearing after the course.</p>"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
